ker\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Blade of Despair\",\"text\":\"Purchase Blade of Despair (3,010 gold) as item 6 in the Jungle Armor Breaker build for Saber.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/saber#build-jungle-armor-breaker\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/saber\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-20T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-08-18T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5f:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n60:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":3,\"name\":\"Saber\",\"slug\":\"saber\",\"title\":\"Wandering Sword\",\"role\":[\"Assassin\"],\"specialty\":[\"Charge\",\"Finisher\"],\"lane\":[\"Jungle\",\"Roam\"],\"tier\":\"B\",\"difficulty\":1,\"releaseYear\":2016,\"stats\":{\"durability\":20,\"offense\":60,\"controlEffect\":60,\"difficulty\":30},\"winRate\":49.99,\"pickRate\":1.03,\"banRate\":23.05,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"layla\",\"heroName\":\"Layla\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Saber's deadly combo makes him strong against squishy heroes, such as Layla and Eudora.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"eudora\",\"heroName\":\"Eudora\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Saber's deadly combo makes him strong against squishy heroes, such as Layla and Eudora.\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"estes\",\"heroName\":\"Estes\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Saber is countered by Support heroes with Survivability buffs, like Estes and Faramis.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"faramis\",\"heroName\":\"Faramis\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Saber is countered by Support heroes with Survivability buffs, like Estes and Faramis.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/mlbb/homepage/100_15e49c7cc5398ca2d903a485145c0702.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_6bbfac806f29d29f17fea9e98d2d2fee.png\",\"officialMatchups\":[{\"kind\":\"best_ally\",\"heroId\":\"42\",\"heroName\":\"Harley\",\"heroSlug\":\"harley\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_a2f1d7806d874283c83913f14a533bb0.png\",\"tip\":\"Saber’s control skill can help Harley to achieve maximum damage output. Their excellent mobility can generate great momentum in the early game.\"},{\"kind\":\"counters\",\"heroId\":\"46\",\"heroName\":\"Odette\",\"heroSlug\":\"odette\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/madmin/image/071fd5539ac4ba53b1dc27195cd6d4bd.png?w=150-150-fff8da\",\"tip\":\"Layla, Odette -- Heroes without displacement skills are very vulnerable to Saber’s sudden charge.\"},{\"kind\":\"countered_by\",\"heroId\":\"48\",\"heroName\":\"Diggie\",\"heroSlug\":\"diggie\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_84b30de71c6315ecc936a8b4d5076efc.png\",\"tip\":\"Diggie’s ultimate skill can cancel the control effect of Saber’s control skill.\"}],\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Enemy's Bane\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"Each time Saber deals damage, he reduces the target's Physical Defense by 3-8 for 5s (up to 5 stacks).\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Each time Saber deals damage, he reduces the target's \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Defense\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" by 3-8 for 5s (up to 5 stacks).\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_1ec282b532be7af31153ce75b206f112.png\",\"tags\":[\"Debuff\"]},{\"name\":\"Orbiting Swords\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Saber releases 5 swords that orbit around him and deal 75 (+25% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage to nearby enemies on hit. The swords will retract back to him after the duration.\\n\\nWhile active, Sword attacks deal 200 (+50% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage to the target and 50% damage to enemies along the path (damage reduced to 50% against minions). Each sword attack reduces the cooldowns of Orbiting Swords by 0.5s and Charge by 1s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Saber releases 5 swords that orbit around him and deal 75\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+25% Extra Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to nearby enemies on hit. The swords will retract back to him after the duration.\\n\\nWhile active, Sword attacks deal 200\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+50% Extra Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to the target and 50% damage to enemies along the path (damage reduced to 50% against minions). Each sword attack reduces the cooldowns of \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Orbiting Swords\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" by 0.5s and \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Charge\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" by 1s.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"10s\",\"manaCost\":\"60\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c6294839bbadfa6f203cd57bdc15efe2.png\",\"tags\":[\"AOE\",\"Buff\"]},{\"name\":\"Charge\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"Saber dashes in the target direction, dealing 75 (+50% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies along the path.\\n\\nAfter the dash, he gains an Enhanced Basic Attack that allows him to charge at the target, dealing 75 (+120% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and slowing them by 60% for 1s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Saber dashes in the target direction, dealing 75\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+50% Extra Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to enemies along the path.\\n\\nAfter the dash, he gains an \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Enhanced Basic Attack\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" that allows him to charge at the target, dealing 75\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+120% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" and slowing them by 60% for 1s.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"7s\",\"manaCost\":\"40\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_8607d91bbdff281d5bba7618f3ed4c98.png\",\"tags\":[\"Mobility\"]},{\"name\":\"Triple Sweep\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"Saber charges at the target enemy hero, knocking them airborne for 1.2s (unaffected by Resilience). He strikes them 3 times over the duration, dealing 120 (+80% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage with the first 2 strikes and 240 (+160% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage with the third.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Saber charges at the target enemy hero, knocking them airborne for 1.2s (unaffected by Resilience). He strikes them 3 times over the duration, dealing 120\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+80% Extra Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" with the first 2 strikes and 240\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+160% Extra Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" with the third.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"44s\",\"manaCost\":\"100\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_fc47930fd50e062bf6e8c8c0398e237c.png\",\"tags\":[\"Burst\",\"CC\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"3-1-2\",\"skillPriorityTip\":\"Max 1, then 2. Level up ultimate when possible.\\nRetribution - Use it to scale within the jungle. On initial buy get Hunter's Knife, rush for Nimble Blade for more efficient jungling, but no need to upgrade it to Raptor's Machete. During the late game, sell it and buy something else. Roam lots, use your ultimate to initiate, cooperate with your teammates in bursting down enemies.up.\",\"skillPriorityTipRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Max 1, then 2. Level up ultimate when possible.\"},{\"type\":\"lineBreak\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Retribution - Use it to scale within the jungle. On initial buy get Hunter's Knife, rush for Nimble Blade for more efficient jungling, but no need to upgrade it to Raptor's Machete. During the late game, sell it and buy something else. Roam lots, use your ultimate to initiate, cooperate with your teammates in bursting down enemies.up.\"}]},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"kadita\",\"heroName\":\"Kadita\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Saber works well with high-damage heroes who can help him burst down enemy heroes in teamfights, such as Kadita and Cyclops.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"cyclops\",\"heroName\":\"Cyclops\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Saber works well with high-damage heroes who can help him burst down enemy heroes in teamfights, such as Kadita and Cyclops.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"Saber can use his 1st Skill to poke and weaken the enemy, follow with his 2nd Skill to close in, then use his Ultimate to finish them off.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":310,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c6294839bbadfa6f203cd57bdc15efe2.png\"},{\"skillId\":320,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_8607d91bbdff281d5bba7618f3ed4c98.png\"},{\"skillId\":330,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_fc47930fd50e062bf6e8c8c0398e237c.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"Saber can use his 1st Skill to poke and weaken the enemy, follow with his 2nd Skill to close in, then use his Ultimate to finish them off.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":310,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c6294839bbadfa6f203cd57bdc15efe2.png\"},{\"skillId\":320,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_8607d91bbdff281d5bba7618f3ed4c98.png\"},{\"skillId\":330,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_fc47930fd50e062bf6e8c8c0398e237c.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Saber build, counter, and emblem guide for Mobile Legends. Hunter Strike plus Heptaseas pick windows, flank rules, flex items, and fight target priority.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Saber is not a jungler you blind because you want a clean 5v5. He is a draft weapon for deleting one hero on command, then making every objective fight feel unsafe for the enemy backline. If the draft gives him no clean target and no exit lane, pick someone else.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"saber\",\"patch\":\"2.1.67\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-08-18\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"jungle-pickoff-default\",\"name\":\"Jungle Pickoff Default\",\"roleContext\":\"Jungle\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"magic-boots\",\"name\":\"Magic Boots\",\"cost\":710,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"hunter-strike\",\"name\":\"Hunter Strike\",\"cost\":2010,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"blade-of-the-heptaseas\",\"name\":\"Blade of the Heptaseas\",\"cost\":1950,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"malefic-roar\",\"name\":\"Malefic Roar\",\"cost\":2060,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"blade-of-despair\",\"name\":\"Blade of Despair\",\"cost\":3010,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\",\"cost\":2120,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"hunter-strike\",\"name\":\"Hunter Strike\"},{\"slug\":\"blade-of-the-heptaseas\",\"name\":\"Blade of the Heptaseas\"},{\"slug\":\"malefic-roar\",\"name\":\"Malefic Roar\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"assassin\",\"name\":\"Assassin Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"rupture\",\"name\":\"Rupture\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/rupture.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"seasoned-hunter\",\"name\":\"Seasoned Hunter\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/seasoned-hunter.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"lethal-ignition\",\"name\":\"Lethal Ignition\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/lethal-ignition.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"retribution\",\"name\":\"Retribution\"},\"blessing\":{\"slug\":\"flame-retribution\",\"name\":\"Flame Retribution\"},\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"magic-boots\",\"name\":\"Magic Boots\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when crowd control, slows, or early magic damage keep Saber from exiting after Triple Sweep.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"rose-gold-meteor\",\"name\":\"Rose Gold Meteor\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"},\"trigger\":\"Use against magic burst when the Lifeline shield protects the first dive better than a delayed revive.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"sea-halberd\",\"name\":\"Sea Halberd\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"blade-of-despair\",\"name\":\"Blade of Despair\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when healing, shields, or high-extra-HP targets survive the first burst window too often.\"}],\"notes\":\"Default jungle setup for fast level-four pickoffs, using Orbiting Swords to prime Hunter Strike, Heptaseas, Lethal Ignition, and Flame Retribution around one locked target.\",\"totalCost\":11860,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"physatk\",\"labelKey\":\"commo