has been augmented with advanced technology that allows him to control orbiting blades with his mind. He arrived in the Land of Dawn through a dimensional rift, driven by an unshakeable obsession to find and defeat the strongest opponent in existence. His Triple Sweep can lock down and shred any target in seconds, and his orbiting swords form both an impenetrable defense and a devastating offense. Saber speaks little of his origins, but the scars on his cybernetic frame tell the story of countless battles across multiple worlds, all in pursuit of the ultimate duel.\",\"allies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"natalia\",\"heroName\":\"Natalia\",\"relationship\":\"Stealth operative who scouts targets for his blade\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"johnson\",\"heroName\":\"Johnson\",\"relationship\":\"Eruditio mechanical warrior and technological kindred spirit\"}],\"rivals\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"aamon\",\"heroName\":\"Aamon\",\"relationship\":\"Invisible shard master whose stealth counters his precision\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"hayabusa\",\"heroName\":\"Hayabusa\",\"relationship\":\"Shadow ninja and rival swordsman of equal caliber\"}]},\"loreUrlName\":\"Saber\",\"statsHistory\":[{\"date\":\"2026-09-07\",\"winRate\":50.27,\"pickRate\":1.04,\"banRate\":27.56},{\"date\":\"2026-09-10\",\"winRate\":50.26,\"pickRate\":1.04,\"banRate\":27.52},{\"date\":\"2026-09-16\",\"winRate\":50.36,\"pickRate\":1.03,\"banRate\":27.03},{\"date\":\"2026-09-28\",\"winRate\":48.72,\"pickRate\":1.04,\"banRate\":21.29},{\"date\":\"2026-10-02\",\"winRate\":48.93,\"pickRate\":1.01,\"banRate\":21.46},{\"date\":\"2026-10-09\",\"winRate\":49.55,\"pickRate\":0.98,\"banRate\":21.76},{\"date\":\"2026-10-17\",\"winRate\":49.99,\"pickRate\":1.03,\"banRate\":23.05}]},\"relatedHeroesSlot\":\"$L66\",\"statsSeoSlot\":\"$L67\",\"fieldManualSlot\":\"$L68\"}]\n61:[\"$\",\"$L69\",null,{\"heroName\":\"Saber\",\"heroSlug\":\"saber\",\"roles\":\"$60:props:hero:role\",\"lanes\":\"$60:props:hero:lane\",\"difficulty\":1,\"winRate\":49.99,\"pickRate\":1.03,