\"]]}],\"$L79\",\"$L7a\"]}]]}]}],\"$L7b\",\"$L7c\"]}]]}]\n68:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative content-lazy lg:grid lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_clamp(230px,24%,300px)] lg:gap-x-6 xl:gap-x-8 lg:items-start\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"lg:order-2 lg:sticky lg:self-start\",\"style\":{\"top\":128},\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L7d\",null,{\"target\":\"#hero-article\"}]}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"hero-article\",\"className\":\"relative lg:order-1 bg-[#0a0a0a]/85 backdrop-blur-sm border border-[#C8AA6E]/15 p-5 md:p-9 overflow-hidden\",\"style\":{\"boxShadow\":\"0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.03) inset, 0 18px 38px -24px rgba(0,0,0,0.8)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#F0D060]/55 to-transparent\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-[#F0D060]/40\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-[#C8AA6E]/30\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-[#C8AA6E]/30\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-[#C8AA6E]/30\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute -top-32 -right-24 w-72 h-72 rounded-full bg-[#C8AA6E]/[0.05] blur-3xl pointer-events-none\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative hero-article-body max-w-[860px] mx-auto\",\"children\":[[[[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-0\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"Draft Saber to remove one player\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[\"Patch 2.1.88 (\",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"/patch-notes\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"patch notes\"}],\") reshaped him on purpose. Moonton raised his base durability and added sustained damage around Triple Sweep, specifically so he can run Fighter equipment instead of pure glass burst. That opens a second, slower build (covered in the itemization section), but it does not change the real draft test. Saber is still a pick tool first and a sustained bruiser second.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-1\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Pick Saber when the enemy comp has one hero whose game falls apart if they die first every fight. That can be an immobile gold laner, a mage with no instant self-peel, or a mobility assassin that thinks movement alone is enough protection. He is especially useful when the enemy win condition is concentrated in one body and your own draft has enough frontline to occupy everyone else while you take the side door.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-2\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"He is a strong answer into teams that lean too hard on one slippery damage dealer. A Hayabusa, Harley, or Fanny player wants messy fights and loose spacing. Saber turns that into a point-and-click appointment. He is also fine into ordinary backline drafts where the gold laner is protected mostly by positioning rather than by cleanse, immunity, or hard peel.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-3\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Do not blind him into double-frontline drafts with a real peel roamer behind them. Khufra, Akai, Kaja, Franco, Chou, and Yu Zhong are all bad news for the same reason: even if you reach the target, the exit is rarely clean. Saber also gets worse when the enemy can split threat across two carries instead of one. If you cannot say before the loading screen which exact hero you are ulting first in every important fight, Saber is the wrong jungle pick.\"}],\"\\n\",\"$L7e\",\"\\n\",\"$L7f\",\"\\n\",\"$L80\",\"\\n\",\"$L81\",\"\\n\",\"$L82\",\"\\n\",\"$L83\",\"\\n\",\"$L84\",\"\\n\",\"$L85\",\"\\n\",\"$L86\",\"\\n\",\"$L87\",\"\\n\",\"$L88\",\"\\n\",\"$L89\",\"\\n\",\"$L8a\"],\"$L8b\",\"$L8c\"],\"$L8d\"]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"a5:I[392015,[\"$7\",\"$8\",\"$9\",\"$a\",\"$b\",\"$2e\",\"$3e\",\"$3f\"],\"default\"]\nb5:I[131354,[\"$7\",\"$8\",\"$9\",\"$a\",\"$b\",\"$2e\",\"$3e\",\"$3f\"],\"default\"]\n6d:[\"$\",\"$L6a\",\"paquito\",{\"href\":\"/heroes/paquito\",\"className\":\"group block\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative bg-surface-4 border border-mlbb-gold/20 overflow-hidden card-hover hover:border-mlbb-gold/50\",\"style\":{\"boxShadow\":\"0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 p-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative w-14 h-14 rounded-full overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0 bg-surface-3\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L6b\",null,{\"src\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_5ab87805b9107b126a3bab64a8a199ad.png\",\"alt\":\"Paquito - The Heavenly Fist\",\"unoptimized\":false,\"priority\":\"$undefined\",\"fetchPriority\":\"$undefined\",\"fill\":true,\"className\":\"object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300\",\"sizes\":\"56px\",\"placeholder\":\"blur\",\"blurDataURL\":\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMTAwIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEwMCIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj48cmVjdCB3aWR0aD0iMTAwIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEwMCIgZmlsbD0iIzBkMTIyNSIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\