]}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L40\",null,{\"href\":\"/tier-list?rank=mythical_glory\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-text-accent hover:text-text-accent-bright transition-colors\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankTierListLink\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Mythical Glory+\"}}],\" →\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-muted text-[13px] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceLead\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Mythical Glory+\",\"name\":\"Saber\"}}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"53.29\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceMid1\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"Saber\",\"delta\":\"+3.04%\"}}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"0.58\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceMid2\"}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"4.74\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceAfter\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Mythical Glory+\"}}]]}]]}]\na6:[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-1\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Tough Boots\"}]\na7:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-5\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"After that, read the lobby instead of copying one fixed six-slot list:\"}]\na8:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-0\",{\"className\":\"list-disc list-inside text-[#9BA0B4] my-3 space-y-2 ml-2\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Malefic Roar\"}],\" when the enemy frontliner, roamer, or even your intended carry has started stacking physical defense. If Antique Cuirass or similar armor shows up, this stops your combo from suddenly feeling fake.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Blade of Despair\"}],\" when you are ahead and the enemy backline is still building like you do not exist. This is the greedy punish item. Buy it when you are ending the game, not when you are trying to solve a problem.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-2\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Endless Battle\"}],\" when fights are lasting one beat longer and you need the extra true-damage basic attack after a skill cast instead of only front-loaded burst. It also gives enough movement and sustain to make messy skirmishes less punishing.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-3\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"War Axe\"}],\" when the draft pushes you into the EXP lane or a comp that forces drawn-out brawls instead of clean pickoffs. The 2.1.88 durability buff is what makes this sustained-fighter pivot real: War Axe stacks attack and true damage the longer you stay swinging, trading the one-and-done flank for a body that can actually fight twice.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-4\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Sea Halberd\"}],\" into Estes, Rafaela, Esmeralda, Yu Zhong, Freya, or any draft where your first target keeps surviving through heal or shield support. Saber is useless if the carry lives your opener at 10% and gets reset back to half.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-5\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Immortality\"}],\" when shutdown gold is on your head or every deep pick is becoming a one-for-one. If the only way the enemy can come back is by cashing your death, the revive is often worth more than another damage slot.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\na9:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-6\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Pick the build from the role, not from habit. Jungle Saber still buys for entry, kill certainty, and escape: that pickoff fantasy is the default, and the assassin emblem feeds it. The sustained Fighter line that 2.1.88 enabled is the exception, not the new normal. Reach for it only when the draft denies you a clean target and forces you to fight through bodies. The moment you can still delete one carry and leave, build for the pickoff and stop theory-crafting a brawler.\"}]\naa:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-2\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"Mistakes that turn Saber into a trade\"]}]\nab:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-7\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Pressing Triple Sweep before Orbiting Swords.\"}],\" This is the cleanest way to remove half your own threat. S1 is not optional decoration. It is the layer that makes the target easier to kill and your exit easier to find.\"]}]\nac:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-8\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Picking Saber to solve a tank problem.\"}],\" He is not the answer to a thick front line. He is the answer to one vulnerable backline piece. If your real issue is that the enemy has too much beef and too much peel, Saber is not fixing the draft.\"]}]\nad:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-9\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Using Charge as pure engage instead of as angle correction.\"}],\" Charge looks like a start button, so weaker players spend it too early. Then the enemy flashes sideways, cleanses, or kites out, and Saber has no way to adjust. Walk first. Let Heptaseas or brush angle begin the play. Save Charge for the line that actually kills.\"]}]\nae:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-10\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Showing on the map before the objective fight.\"}],\" Saber without fog is a warning sign, not a threat. The moment the enemy carry sees you on a wave, they stop farming alone and stand inside their tank's hitbox. Good Sabers disappear before Turtle, Lord, or the outer-tower siege, then show up exactly once.\"]}]\naf:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-11\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Forcing the combo into immunity or layered peel.\"}],\" Miya, Wanwan, Wind of Nature marksmen, and supports with instant save buttons all punish impatient Sabers. Bait the defensive button first or choose a different target. Your hero is built around guaranteed access, not guaranteed immunity to bad decisions.\"]}]\nb0:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-3\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"Key tips\"]}]\nb1:[\"$\",\"div\",\"blockquote-0\",{\"className\":\"my-5 p-4 flex gap-3\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"rgba(200,170,110,0.08)\",\"border\":\"1px solid rgba(200,170,110,0.35)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-lightbulb w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#C8AA6E\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1gvzjb\",{\"d\":\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"x1upvd\",{\"d\":\"M9 18h6\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"ceow96\",{\"d\":\"M10 22h4\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#C8AA6E\"},\"children\":\"Tip\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"If Orbiting Swords is already active, every follow-up basic attack throws another sword and shortens Charge's cooldown. One extra auto after the lift is often what gives you the dash to leave.\"]}]]]}]]}]\nb2:[\"$\",\"div\",\"blockquote-1\",{\"className\":\"my-5 p-4 flex gap-3\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"rgba(0,170,255,0.08)\",\"border\":\"1px solid rgba(0,170,255,0.35)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-info w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#00AAFF\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"circle\",\"1mglay\",{\"cx\":\"12\",\"cy\":\"12\",\"r\":\"10\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"1dtifu\",{\"d\":\"M12 16v-4\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"e9boi3\",{\"d\":\"M12 8h.01\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#00AAFF\"},\"children\":\"Note\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Blade of the Heptaseas only arms after five seconds without dealing or taking damage. If you clip a jungle creep, a minion, or a tank on the way to a flank, you removed your own best opener.\"]}]]]}]]}]\nb3:[\"$\",\"div\",\"blockquote-2\",{\"className\":\"my-5 p-4 flex gap-3\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"rgba(200,170,110,0.08)\",\"border\":\"1px solid rgba(200,170,110,0.35)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-lightbulb w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#C8AA6E\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1gvzjb\",{\"d\":\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"x1upvd\",{\"d\":\"M9 18h6\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"ceow96\",{\"d\":\"M10 22h4\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#C8AA6E\"},\"children\":\"Tip\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Triple Sweep still deals its damage even if the airborne portion gets cleansed. The real question against Purify-type answers is whether you can survive the counter-hit after landing, not whether the skill connects at all.\"]}]]]}]]}]\nb4:[\"$\",\"div\",\"blockquote-3\",{\"className\":\"my-5 p-4 flex gap-3\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"rgba(0,170,255,0.08)\",\"border\":\"1px solid rgba(0,170,255,0.35)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-info w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#00AAFF\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"circle\",\"1mglay\",{\"cx\":\"12\",\"cy\":\"12\",\"r\":\"10\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"1dtifu\",{\"d\":\"M12 16v-4\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"e9boi3\",{\"d\":\"M12 8h.01\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#00AAFF\"},\"children\":\"Note\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Hero Lock Mode matters more on Saber than on almost any other assassin. Wrong target does not cost a little damage. It costs the entire fight.\"]}]]]}]]}]\n"])</script></body></html>